From 25a816238da189a74f8d5f3634023f3b44a9943c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AOSP RK3576 Baseline <uhf-platform@localbuild>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 13:30:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] sepolicy: mirror the uhf_service ignore-list entries into
 prebuilts/api/34.0

Real build failure, found by actually running the build after the
previous commit: sepolicy_freeze_test diffs system/sepolicy/private in
full against prebuilts/api/34.0/private, which includes
compat/*/*.ignore.cil - the same class of gap the two earlier
freeze_test/service.te and service_contexts fixes in this series covered
for the other affected files. Mirrors the identical uhf_service addition
into all five prebuilts/api/34.0/private/compat/*/*.ignore.cil files.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
